    "description": "Need an effective Cleaner & Antivirus? With mobile Cleaner Antivirus VPN app you can easily and effectively clean your phone and protect it from viruses!!\r\n\r\nWith help of this master cleaner for Android and mobile antivirus for Android you\u2019ll easily clean cache, clear junk, reclaim space after the cleanup, moreover you\u2019ll be able to clean viruses. Sounds good, doesn\u2019t it? \r\n\r\n<u>What FREE CLEANER ANTIVIRUS VPN has to offer:</u>\r\n\r\n<b>FREE ANTIVIRUS & PROTECTION</b> \r\nSometimes a small virus you might not even know about can cause a lot of trouble. To make sure this doesn\u2019t happen, use efficient antivirus. <b>Real-time phone and apps protection</b> will scan your phone for viruses, malware, trojans, threats and vulnerabilities, block and remove viruses, get rid of potential privacy threats, virus cleaner will <b>keep your phone safe and protect your privacy</b>. Our antivirus software continuously updates its virus definitions database to stay ahead of emerging threats, ensuring maximum security for your device. Moreover, the app offers customizable scanning options, allowing users to perform quick scans for routine protection or enable real-time protection feature for 24/7 security.\r\n\r\n<b>FREE PHONE CLEANER & STORAGE CLEANER</b>\r\nEffective clean master and cache cleaner for your phone. Cleaning has never been so easy and efficient! It\u2019s a memory <b>cleaner & junk cleaner</b> that you\u2019ll actually use and enjoy the results. Clear memory feature is extremely easy to use and safe: <b>clean junk, clean cache, get rid of all the unnecessary files and close apps that take up phone memory and slow down its performance</b>! Cleaning phone and closing unnecessary apps significantly helps your phone work better. You will see the difference.\r\n\r\n<b>FREE VPN</b>\r\nUse VPN to enhance your online privacy and ensure that you are safe and anonymous while browsing the Internet. It will also protect you when you use a public Wifi hotspot and will allow you to <b>create a safe and secure connection</b>. <b>Lots of servers all across the world</b> available in the app will make sure that <b>you\u2019re safe and sound online</b>.\r\n\r\n<b>FREE NOTIFICATION BLOCKER</b>\r\nThis feature will stop unnecessary notifications from slowing down your phone and getting on your nerves, your phone will be <b>free from disturbing and annoying notifications</b>. \r\n\r\n<b>FREE FILE MANAGER</b>\r\nWith use of our File manager you will <b>easily manage files and folders on your device</b>. You can use it to transfer files between your devices and PC, work with OneDrive, DropBox and other services. It helps you keep files organized, quickly share them and <b>use your phone\u2019s space wisely</b>.\r\n\r\nWith this <b>Cleaner master & powerful antivirus</b> your user experience will never be the same again. Install Cleaner Antivirus VPN Cleaner app and enjoy your <b>phone\u2019s safe & smooth operation</b>!\r\nIn this app you can use the AccessibilityService API to clean up, easily customize your device, and secure your apps and data. Through the AccessibilityService API, we do not collect or share your personal data with third parties.\r\n\r\nIn this app, the QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES permission is used, which allows obtaining a list of all apps installed on your device. This is necessary to check all apps for viruses and vulnerabilities in order to secure your device and the data on it.",
